// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// FRONTIER & PHILOSOPHY VOYAGER  |  L16 — The Philosophy of Religion
// Age band : voyagers (11-12)   Guide: orion (Phoenix)
// Standards: Coreverse Original — Philosophy, Philosophy of Religion, Metaphysics, Ethics
// CALIBRATED: Voyager spec v1.1 (May 2026)
