          type: `welcome`,
          guideText: `{name}. Today we approach some of the largest and most personal questions any human being ever asks: Does God exist? What would that even mean? What is the relationship between faith and reason? These are not questions philosophy can definitively settle — but philosophy can clarify exactly what's at stake, where the arguments are strong, and where they fail. This lesson does that honestly, without dismissing any position.`,
          headline: `The Philosophy of Religion`,
